<title>LITHUANIA: MAZEIKIU NAFTA REFINES LESS CRUDE IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>MAZEIKIU NAFTA REFINES LESS CRUDE IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's oil refinery Mazeikiu Nafta said on Tuesday it refined 477,136 tonnes of crude oil in April compared to 483,961 tonnes a month before.</p>
<p>The company refined 174,337 tonnes of crude oil in April 1996.</p>
<p>The company also said in a statement that during the four month of this year it has refined 1.6 million tonnes of crude, a sharp rise from 881,808 tonnes in the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
